OL,3,ALucy Letby public inquiry findings set
OL,4,Ato be published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe findings from a public inquiry into
OL,7,Fhow Lucy Letby was able to repeatedly
OL,8,Fmurder and harm babies will be
OL,9,Fpublished later on Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry was set up to
OL,12,Flook into what happened at the Countess
OL,13,Fof Chester Hospital between 2015 and
OL,14,F2016, while Letby was working as a
OL,15,Fnurse in the neonatal unit.
OL,17,FLetby, now 36, is serving 15 whole-life
OL,18,Fprison terms for murdering seven babies
OL,19,Fand attempting to murder seven others,
OL,20,Fincluding one baby whom she tried to
OL,21,Fmurder twice.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
