OL,3,AHarry and Meghan to have security
OL,4,Areview and children change school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,7,Fgoing to be given a review of their
OL,8,Fpublicly-funded security, following
OL,9,Ftheir return to live in the UK.
OL,11,FIt is understood that the committee
OL,12,Fwhich oversees royal and VIP security,
OL,13,Fknown as Ravec, is to reconsider Prince
OL,14,FHarry and Meghan's level of police
OL,15,Fprotection now that they and their two
OL,16,Fchildren are full-time residents rather
OL,17,Fthan visitors.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
