OL,3,AWelsh actor Matthew Rhys makes Emmy
OL,4,AAwards history with double win
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh actor Matthew Rhys has made
OL,7,Fhistory at the Emmy Awards, becoming
OL,8,Fthe first person to win two lead acting
OL,9,Fprizes in one night.
OL,11,FRhys was recognised at the prestigious
OL,12,FUS ceremony for his roles in
OL,13,Fsupernatural TV comedy Widow's Bay and
OL,14,Fpsychological thriller The Beast In Me.
OL,16,FOn stage, Rhys dedicated his second
OL,17,Faward "to the great and good people of
OL,18,FWales, who were as much a nurture as
OL,19,Fanyone else".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
